# Which deployment a fresh visitor lands on. 677 is BOT Chain mainnet, 968 the
# testnet. Everything else about a deployment - addresses, settlement asset,
# and its precision - lives in lib/networks.ts, because the network switch is a
# runtime control and a build-time variable cannot answer for both chains.
#
# This is the only variable the app reads. Nothing here needs setting to run it.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CHAIN_ID=677
